ave to help him finish off ramsay  then we will get this scene or maybe  stannis wins but ramsay doesn't die  for some reason i feel like ramsay has  to be alive for his hounds to fight the  stark's direwolves but i guess it isn't  necessary although i think it would make  for a much better scene if he was there  maybe stannis wins and gets winterfell  but ramsay doesn't die i guess he could  always go on the run or to another  castle where the stark saying their  direwolves could face off against him  then however i'm not so sure stannis  will win that battle now i don't think  he will die like he did in the show  maybe he loses the first battle and  that's when the starks join him later  for a second battle or maybe stannis  does meet the same fate he did in game  of thrones then some of the starks could  reunite and force ramsay out of their  home one way or another what i love so  much about this one little note is there  are so many different scenarios that  could unfold there is one other option i  should mention because george rr martin  has hinted at something else happening  that does involve our furry four-legged  friends in one of george r martin's many  interviews he once said you know i don't  like to give things away but you don't  hang a giant wolf pack on the wall  unless you intend to use it this has  always made me wonder when we will see  this as well i can't help but wonder if  this is what he means when he says  ramsay sounds will face the dire wolves  of house stark now when it comes to  nymeria and her pack of wolves she is  obviously the only one of house stark  but depending on how things unfold you  never know if all of them will end up  following arya before the end maybe he  will have arya and nymeria reunite sort  of like they did in the show only they  could have a much larger role in the  books regardless of the scenario i hope  we see ramsay and his hounds suffer a  vicious defeat at the hands of hal stark  let me know what your thoughts are about  the scene left out of game of thrones  and also let me know how you think it  will happen in the books will ramsay  still have winterfell when this happens  and if so what does that mean for  stannis the manas as always i want to  thank each and every one of you for  watching my video i hope you all have a  great day i'll see you soon bye  [Music]  you

